The page built from this directory bundles third-party packages under their own licences. They are listed, with
their licence texts, in public/THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.txt, which is copied into every build
(node scripts/third-party-notices.mjs writes it from the lockfile; `--check` fails when it is out of date).
Two of them are not open-source licences: see ../docs/LICENSING.md section 4.
